flowchart LR
  D[Managed device\nCloudflare One Client] -->|Device identity| CF[Cloudflare custom\nservice provider]
  CF -->|POST /check every 10 min\nAccess application token| W[Posture Worker\nJWT validation]
  W -->|Read cached mapping + score| DB[(D1\nMappings and snapshots)]
  W -->|0 or 100 per device| CF
  CF --> P{Posture check\nScore >= 100?}
  P -->|Pass| A[Access or Gateway policy\nAllow managed resource]
  P -->|Fail| B[Block access]
  CRON[Cron trigger\nevery 5 min] --> Q[Cloudflare Queue\nBatched refresh jobs]
  W -->|Unknown device discovery| Q
  Q -->|endpoint_id_list\nup to 100| X[Cortex XDR API]
  X -->|Protection state, last seen,\nlast content update time| Q
  Q -->|Verified hostname + MAC mapping\nand evaluated score| DB
